OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackling large
OL,4,Ascrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are continuing to tackle a
OL,7,Flarge fire at a scrapyard in Barnsley,
OL,8,Fwhich broke out on Saturday night.
OL,10,FFootage shared on social media showed
OL,11,Fhuge plumes of black smoke billowing
OL,12,Facross the sky from the blaze in
OL,13,FBoulder Bridge Lane, Carlton.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,F(SYFRS) said it was called to the area
OL,17,Fon Saturday evening, with 10 engines,
OL,18,Fan aerial ladder platform and a number
OL,19,Fof operational support vehicles
OL,20,Fdeployed to the scene at its peak.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
