OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackling large
OL,4,Ascrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the fire involved quantities of
OL,7,Fscrap metal and tyres, and advised
OL,8,Fpeople living nearby to keep their
OL,9,Fwindows and doors closed.
